{"step_index":77,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-09-13T07:04:18Z","thinking":"With backend API routes completed, the focus shifts to developing the frontend UI. The plan includes styling and theming, specifically implementing dark mode with ChatGPT aesthetics, custom scrollbars, and typography enhancements via `globals.css`. Subsequently, a layout file (`layout.tsx`) will be established to handle fonts, meta tags, and the application title (\"UMGN - Personal AI Chatbot\"), ensuring responsiveness.\n\n\nNow examining the structure of frontend components, specifically message rendering, sidebar layout, and settings modal. Initial focus centers on constructing individual chat messages, including markdown parsing and code block styling with a copy feature. Subsequently, the sidebar design mimicking ChatGPT functionality will be implemented, incorporating chat listing with edit and delete capabilities, and filtering. The settings modal design requires theme customization, AI configurations, and data controls with privacy notices.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"write_to_file","args":{"CodeContent":"@tailwind base;\n@tailwind components;\n@tailwind utilities;\n\n:root {\n  --background: #ffffff;\n  --foreground: #0d0d0d;\n}\n\n.dark {\n  --background: #212121;\n  --foreground: #ececec;\n}\n\nbody {\n  color: var(--foreground);\n  background: var(--background);\n  font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Segoe UI\", Roboto, Oxygen,\n    Ubuntu, Cantarell, \"Fira Sans\", \"Droid Sans\", \"Helvetica Neue\", sans-serif;\n  overflow: hidden;\n}\n\n/* Custom sleek scrollbar */\n::-webkit-scrollbar {\n  width: 6px;\n  height: 6px;\n}\n\n::-webkit-scrollbar-track {\n  background: transparent;\n}\n\n::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb {\n  background: rgba(150, 150, 150, 0.25);\n  border-radius: 9999px;\n}\n\n::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb:hover {\n  background: rgba(150, 150, 150, 0.45);\n}\n\n/* Code block styling */\npre {\n  position: relative;\n  background-color: #171717 !important;\n  border-radius: 0.5rem;\n  padding: 1rem;\n  overflow-x: auto;\n  border: 1px solid #333333;\n}\n\ncode {\n  font-family: ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, Menlo, Monaco, Consolas, \"Liberation Mono\", \"Courier New\", monospace;\n  font-size: 0.9em;\n}\n\n/* Streaming blinking cursor */\n@keyframes blink {\n  0%, 100% { opacity: 1; }\n  50% { opacity: 0; }\n}\n\n.cursor-blink {\n  display: inline-block;\n  width: 7px;\n  height: 15px;\n  background-color: currentColor;\n  margin-left: 3px;\n  vertical-align: middle;\n  animation: blink 0.9s infinite;\n}\n","Description":"Create globals.css for dark mode, sleek scrollbars, code formatting, and blinking cursor animation","Overwrite":true,"TargetFile":"c:\\Users\\LENOVO\\Documents\\ud\\src\\app\\globals.css","toolAction":"Creating globals.css","toolSummary":"Global CSS stylesheet"}}]}
